      "value": "It looks like the position sync is unable to update fast enough at high speeds and It starts updating incorrectly. I would suggest testing it with a few different players or clients and see if the results are different. If they are different then it’s most likely a server issue. Although I’m no expert but thats what came to mind while watching the video you posted.",
