  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you enable Udon position sync for a vehicle that has wheelcolliders, at higher speeds the vehicle will start stuttering and hitting \"invisible speedbumps\" even in a single player instance.\nAs soon as position sync is disabled, the vehicles function as they should for the owner of the vehicle.\nVideo showcasing the issue:\nhttps://youtu.be/7d9EMANFKls",
